# VoiceOver reads a conversation as it shows: after scrolling up through a long
# conversation and back, its message texts still read from the top of the
# screen down, however the list reused its rows, and the rows it left behind
# stay unread. The list is a scroll area whose vertical scroll bar says where
# it is.
# iOS: HistoryUITests, TurnUITests (reading position)
fixture /reading-conversation/reading-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Reading conversation*" 20000
expect "Answer 35 ends here." 20000
expect_reading_order この会話 10000
expect_scrolled この会話 0.99 1 10000
scroll この会話 -120
expect_scrolled この会話 0 0.98 10000
expect_reading_order この会話
scroll この会話 -300
expect_reading_order この会話
scroll この会話 120
expect_reading_order この会話
scroll この会話 2000
expect_scrolled この会話 0.99 1 10000
expect_reading_order この会話
expect "Answer 35 ends here."
dump scrolled-back
